{"module":"grammar","item":{"id":"a2-grammar-praepositionen","level":"A2","topic":"Präpositionen","title":{"de":"Präpositionen: mit und in (Wo? / Wohin?)","bn":"Prepositions: mit ও in"},"summary":"mit-এর পরে সবসময় Dativ; in-এর পরে Wo? হলে Dativ, Wohin? হলে Akkusativ।","intro":[{"kind":"text","text":"Preposition হলো ছোট শব্দ, যেমন: in, mit, für, nach, bei।"},{"kind":"text","text":"এগুলো স্থান, সময়, দিক বা সম্পর্ক বোঝায়।"}],"sections":[{"heading":"১. mit — সঙ্গে","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":"mit-এর পরে Dativ হয়।"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Ich fahre mit dem Bus.","bn":"আমি বাসে যাই।"}]},{"kind":"list","items":["mit = সঙ্গে / দিয়ে","dem Bus = বাসে"]},{"kind":"text","text":"আরেকটি উদাহরণ:"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Ich wohne mit meiner Familie.","bn":"আমি আমার পরিবারের সঙ্গে থাকি।"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"এখানে meine Familie পরিবর্তন হয়ে meiner Familie হয়েছে, কারণ mit-এর পরে Dativ লাগে।"}]},{"heading":"২. in — কোথায় আছ, নাকি কোথায় যাচ্ছ?","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":"in একটি বিশেষ preposition। এটি কখনো Dativ, কখনো Akkusativ নেয়।"},{"kind":"list","items":["Wo? (কোথায়?) → Dativ","Wohin? (কোথায় যাচ্ছ?) → Akkusativ"]},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Ich bin in der Schule.","bn":"আমি স্কুলে আছি।"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"Wo? — কোথায়? তাই Dativ: der Schule।"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Ich gehe in die Schule.","bn":"আমি স্কুলে যাচ্ছি।"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"Wohin? — কোথায় যাচ্ছি? তাই Akkusativ: die Schule।"},{"kind":"text","text":"এখানে শুধু চলাফেরা হচ্ছে কি না, সেটি নয়—অবস্থান বোঝাচ্ছে, নাকি কোনো গন্তব্যের দিকে যাওয়া বোঝাচ্ছে, সেটি দেখবে।"}]},{"heading":"আরও উদাহরণ","blocks":[{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Ich spreche mit dem Lehrer.","bn":"আমি শিক্ষকের সঙ্গে কথা বলছি।"},{"de":"Sie schreibt mit einem Kuli.","bn":"সে একটি কলম দিয়ে লেখে।"},{"de":"Das Handy ist in der Tasche.","bn":"ফোনটি ব্যাগের ভেতরে আছে।"},{"de":"Ich lege das Handy in die Tasche.","bn":"আমি ফোনটি ব্যাগের ভেতরে রাখি।"}]}]}],"test":[{"id":"a2-grammar-praepositionen-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich fahre mit ___ Bus.","options":["den","dem","der"],"answer":1,"explanation":"mit-এর পরে Dativ: der Bus → dem Bus।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-praepositionen-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich wohne mit ___ Familie.","options":["meiner","meine","meinen"],"answer":0,"explanation":"mit + Dativ: meine Familie → meiner Familie।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-praepositionen-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich bin in ___ Schule. (আছি)","options":["die","den","der"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Wo? → Dativ: die Schule → der Schule।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-praepositionen-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich gehe in ___ Schule. (যাচ্ছি)","options":["die","der","dem"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Wohin? → Akkusativ: die Schule।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-praepositionen-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Wohin?“ প্রশ্নে in-এর পরে কোন case?","options":["Dativ","Akkusativ","Nominativ"],"answer":1,"explanation":"গন্তব্য (Wohin?) → Akkusativ।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-praepositionen-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"mit-এর পরে সবসময় কোন case?","options":["Akkusativ","Nominativ","Dativ"],"answer":2,"explanation":"mit সবসময় Dativ নেয়।"}]},"schema":1,"id":"a2-grammar-praepositionen","level":"A2","test":[{"id":"a2-grammar-praepositionen-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich fahre mit ___ Bus.","options":["den","dem","der"],"answer":1,"explanation":"mit-এর পরে Dativ: der Bus → dem Bus।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-praepositionen-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich wohne mit ___ Familie.","options":["meiner","meine","meinen"],"answer":0,"explanation":"mit + Dativ: meine Familie → meiner Familie।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-praepositionen-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich bin in ___ Schule. (আছি)","options":["die","den","der"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Wo? → Dativ: die Schule → der Schule।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-praepositionen-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich gehe in ___ Schule. (যাচ্ছি)","options":["die","der","dem"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Wohin? → Akkusativ: die Schule।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-praepositionen-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Wohin?“ প্রশ্নে in-এর পরে কোন case?","options":["Dativ","Akkusativ","Nominativ"],"answer":1,"explanation":"গন্তব্য (Wohin?) → Akkusativ।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-praepositionen-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"mit-এর পরে সবসময় কোন case?","options":["Akkusativ","Nominativ","Dativ"],"answer":2,"explanation":"mit সবসময় Dativ নেয়।"}]}